<title>CHINA: China Jan manganese exports soar 173 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan manganese exports soar 173 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought manganese reached 4,898 tonnes in January, up 173 percent from a year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China exported 45,652 tonnes of unwrought manganese in 1996, down 9.1 percent from 1995, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
